---
import Base from '../../../layouts/Base.astro';
import Header from '../../../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../../../components/Footer.astro';

const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL;
---

<Base
	title="Privacy Policy — Infinitix"
	description="Infinitix privacy policy: the game does not collect, transmit, or share any personal data."
	lang="en"
	altHref={`${base}/privacy/`}
>
	<Header lang="en" esHref={`${base}/privacy/`} enHref={`${base}/en/privacy/`} />

	<main class="prose">
		<h1>Infinitix Privacy Policy</h1>
		<p class="updated"><strong>Last updated:</strong> September 1, 2026</p>

		<h2>Summary</h2>
		<p>
			Infinitix does not collect, transmit, sell, or share any personal data. The game runs
			entirely offline: it has no backend servers, uses no analytics, shows no ads, and has
			no account system.
		</p>

		<h2>What data exists and where it lives</h2>
		<ul>
			<li>
				<strong>Game progress</strong> (high score, per-character records, account level,
				Libras currency, unlocked characters): stored only on-device, in the app's
				private storage. It never leaves the phone and is deleted when the app is
				uninstalled.
			</li>
			<li>
				<strong>Player-created characters</strong> (a name, a description, and a photo
				picked from the device's own gallery, if the player chooses to create a custom
				pilot): also processed and stored only in the app's private, on-device storage.
				The photo is never uploaded to any server or shared with any third party — it's
				used only to draw that character inside the game. The player can delete a custom
				character at any time from within the game, which deletes the stored photo too;
				uninstalling the app deletes everything else.
			</li>
			<li>
				<strong>No other data</strong> is collected: no advertising ID, no location, no
				contacts, no network calls, no analytics of any kind.
			</li>
		</ul>

		<h2>Permissions</h2>
		<p>
			The app only requests access to the device's photo gallery, and only at the moment
			the player chooses to create a custom character and picks an image. That access is
			never used for anything else.
		</p>

		<h2>Children</h2>
		<p>
			Infinitix is not directed specifically at children and does not collect data from
			anyone, regardless of age.
		</p>

		<h2>Changes to this policy</h2>
		<p>
			If this policy changes (for example, if an online feature is ever added), the updated
			version will be published at this same address with a new "last updated" date.
		</p>

		<h2>Contact</h2>
		<p>
			For questions about this policy, contact:
			<a href="mailto:francobusch130@gmail.com">francobusch130@gmail.com</a>.
		</p>
	</main>

	<Footer lang="en" />
</Base>

<style>
	.prose {
		padding-top: 48px;
	}

	.prose h1 {
		color: var(--cyan);
		font-size: 1.8rem;
	}

	.prose h2 {
		color: var(--cyan);
		font-size: 1.15rem;
		margin-top: 2em;
	}

	.prose .updated {
		color: var(--text-dim);
	}

	.prose li {
		margin-bottom: 0.6em;
	}
</style>
